## Pipeline Orchestration & Execution

The end-to-end data flow is orchestrated using Microsoft Fabric Data Pipelines (`pl_fhir_ingestion_medallion`).
The pipeline automates execution across all three Medallion layers, enforcing strict dependency checks and retry policies.


 Key Technical Capabilities
*Sequential Dependency Management:
Notebook activities execute strict linear handoffs ($\text{Bronze} \rightarrow \text{Silver} \rightarrow \text{Gold}$).
A downstream stage triggers only if the prior stage returns a `Succeeded` status.

*Automated Failure Recovery:
Configured with an exponential backoff policy (up to 2 automatic retries with 30-second intervals) to handle transient API network errors and compute cold-starts seamlessly.

*Auditability & Status Tracking:
Fully integrated with Microsoft Fabric monitoring, logging real-time execution duration, dynamic parameter pass-throughs, and detailed Spark job telemetry.
